# A screw thread with a chamfered end made through its screen on an
# extruded circle; the same model as path_thread_chamfer.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalence/thread_chamfer).
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
# Its depth held and typed as 80 on its screen: the model was drawn
# for a deep part, deeper than a new extrusion of this sketch starts.
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
edit 80
click-entity 80030005
menu Features|Screw Thread...
# Flip the direction: against the circle's normal, down into the part, and chamfered.
twmove 60 230
twdown L 60 230
twup L 60 230
twmove 606 230
twdown L 606 230
twup L 606 230
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
